                        "entry_id": "0159e850-d040-39c7-b02b-f58ad5ec5891",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Opposed to humanity."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b06ebb5-5a7f-441f-b43a-ec87f8337c33",
                                "sense_id": "af1a0958-bd25-3c6b-8e02-54b09b7b7038",
                                "text": "What more fierce than the scorn and more violent than the abuse poured on the member of a trades-union whose sound moral feeling rebels against the iniquities sanctioned by its collective conscience, albeit that conscience be essentially antisocial, if not antihuman?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b76a1178-b903-4d02-ad0b-19875a39050e",
                                "sense_id": "af1a0958-bd25-3c6b-8e02-54b09b7b7038",
                                "text": "I would like this antihuman woman to know that she has played right into the hands of abusers everywhere by making this claim."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b2da4eb-a00f-4427-8818-f940d38c0d20",
                                "sense_id": "af1a0958-bd25-3c6b-8e02-54b09b7b7038",
                                "text": "I've rarely seen a sculptural object express contradictions so well: they're both human and antihuman, squat and vertical (because of the drapery folds), heavy and light."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6633bc4-172b-42da-8aa7-dd6ff3d282d4",
                                "sense_id": "af1a0958-bd25-3c6b-8e02-54b09b7b7038",
                                "text": "Isaacson reports that Musk’s fractured relationship with Jenna, who is trans, partly led to Musk’s rightward turn toward libertarianism and questioning what he considers the “woke-mind-virus, which is fundamentally antiscience, antimerit, and antihuman.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
